cked garment type for each family member.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vacation-ready palette:</strong> Pink, blue, and green ombre color looks bright in outdoor family photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Role-bearing sizes:</strong> Size labels clearly separate Child, Mother, and Father rows.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Chart-backed draft:</strong> Only rows visible in the supplied size chart are included as variants.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>T-shirt excluded:</strong> Shirt variants are intentionally omitted per the listing request.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose the dress or shorts size for each family member and build a colorful matching look for sunny trips, beach photos, and relaxed family days.</p>",
